      <h1 class="jr-h1">Best Time to Take Collagen: What the Evidence Actually Says</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">Every page ranking for this question gives a confident answer, usually morning on an empty stomach, sometimes night for sleep. We looked for the trials behind those answers and could not find them. Here is what the evidence does and does not say.</p>

